      "writtenOn": "2022-06-23T17:29:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, but the the EC has limited control over the AP power state. So, docks should be sending both USB PD Alerts and HID events on a button press. Across suspending, resuming, shutting down and starting up, only starting up needs to be handled by the EC because the AP will not be able to process HID events in G3. Shutting down, suspending and resuming should be handled by the AP in response to HID events from the dock. I still need to update the design dock to reflect this.",
