      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done, there are now 2 tests.\n\n1. verify_alert_on_power_state_change - where we are sending alerts due to a power state change\n\n2. verify_startup_on_usb_pd_power_button - where we are receiving alerts from the partner. Note that this does lead to a power state change, so there in both tests we are sending alerts and going through the Alert-\u003eGet_Status-\u003eStatus transaction with the partner. The main difference is that in verify_alert_on_power_state_change we initiate the transaction but in verify_startup_on_usb_pd_power_button the partner initiates it.",
      "parentUuid": "15b6ac3c_75798a52",
