      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure I understand this part. The implementation doesn\u0027t have a check for rejecting short presses. Should nothing happen here because the press is short, or should nothing happen because the AP is already on?",
      "revId": "adf183b3422b5470f5dd38e219b67252950a05e5",
